# 25. Sharpe itself needs proper uncertainty

The repo annualizes Sharpe using a simple `sqrt(periods_per_year)` multiplier.

With serially correlated strategy returns, this can materially misstate Sharpe. Lo's treatment of Sharpe explicitly shows that simple square-root annualization is only justified under restrictive conditions. ([CFA Institute Research and Policy Center][7])

For every promoted strategy report:

```text
raw OOS Sharpe
HAC/serial-correlation-aware Sharpe inference
Probabilistic Sharpe Ratio
Deflated Sharpe Ratio
```

And disclose:

```text
number of independent OOS periods
number of strategies/hyperparameters attempted
```

