# 32. Exact P0 test suite

These should be implemented before more strategy research.

## `test_future_mutation_invariance`

Compute all signals through cutoff `T`.

Then mutate every observation after `T`:

```text
prices ×100
prices ÷100
volume ×10000
funding ±20%
tokenomics absurd values
```

Recompute.

Assert every feature/prediction at `<=T` is bit-identical or within deterministic floating tolerance.

This catches an enormous class of lookahead bugs.

---

## `test_calendar_alignment_not_row_index`

Different listing dates.

Add/remove prehistory.

Same calendar-date cross section must not move.

---

## `test_walk_forward_outputs_only_test_dates`

For each split:

```text
set(output.timestamps) ⊆ set(test.timestamps)
```

And across outer test folds:

```text
no duplicate test timestamps
```

unless overlap is explicitly intended and handled.

---

## `test_fit_receives_train_only`

Instrument estimator and transformers.

Record every observation ID passed into `.fit()`.

Assert:

```text
fit_ids ⊆ train_ids
fit_ids ∩ validation_ids = ∅
fit_ids ∩ calibration_ids = ∅
fit_ids ∩ test_ids = ∅
```

---

## `test_purged_labels_do_not_overlap`

Every labelled row has:

```text
label_start
label_end
```

At a split boundary:

```text
max(train.label_end) < next_partition_start
```

after purge.

---

## `test_same_bar_close_fill_rejected`

Create a feature requiring completed candle `t`.

Attempt fill at that candle's close.

Expected:

```text
ExecutionTimingViolation
```

Fill at next bar should pass.

---

## `test_missing_return_never_zero`

Delete a candle while a position is open.

Assert the engine either:

```text
uses explicit approved stale-mark policy
```

or:

```text
raises MissingMarketDataError
```

Never generates a zero return.

---

## `test_funding_per_symbol_exact_settlements`

Two instruments:

```text
A: +0.01%
B: -0.02%
```

different notionals and settlement times.

Hand-calculate funding ledger.

Assert exact equality and exactly one entry per settlement event.

---

## `test_gross_constraints_enforced_every_bar`

Generate random desired weights.

For every executed portfolio assert:

```text
name cap
short gross
long gross
net exposure
turnover
liquidity participation
```

all satisfy config.

---

## `test_train_serve_parity_golden`

Same PIT snapshot.

Research scorer and live scorer must return identical:

```text
feature vector
score
model probability
```

---

## `test_long_short_pnl_sign`

Use deterministic:

```text
100 → 110
100 → 90
```

Verify long and short PnL manually.

This should catch the paper trader's current issue where `close_positions()` uses the short PnL formula irrespective of direction.

---

## `test_pnl_conservation`

For every run:

```text
ending_equity
==
initial_equity
+ realized_price_pnl
+ unrealized_price_pnl
+ funding
- fees
- slippage
- other_costs
```

to fixed numerical tolerance.

---

## `test_regime_future_invariance`

Future BTC mutations cannot change historical regimes.

---

## `test_cross_sectional_ic_row_order_invariant`

Randomly reorder the complete panel.

IC results must be identical.

---

## `test_no_current_universe_backfill`

Asset:

```text
not listed → listed → delisted
```

The strategy cannot select it before listing or after delisting.

---

## `test_delisted_asset_does_not_disappear`

Have an open position when an instrument delists.

Its PnL must get an explicit settlement/close outcome.

It cannot vanish from history.

---

## `test_cost_missing_liquidity_fails_closed`

The current cost model invents an ADV of $1m when ADV is invalid and estimates depth as a fraction of ADV.

Replace this behaviour.

Missing execution liquidity must not magically become a cheap trade.

---

## `test_rebalance_frequency_honored`

Signals change every day.

Set:

```text
