```

Assert trades occur only on permitted rebalance events.

---

## `test_split_uses_calendar_duration`

The current splitter uses:

```text
months × 21 observations
```

That means twelve months changes meaning depending on hourly vs daily input.

Build hourly and daily fixtures and confirm:

```text
12 months
```

means twelve actual calendar months in both.

---

## `test_no_duplicate_equity_timestamps_across_outer_splits`

Merged OOS curve:

```text
