# 40. Model acceptance should be probabilistic, not narrative

Example promotion rules:

```text
REQUIRE:

n_outer_test_blocks >= threshold

DSR probability >= 0.95

PBO <= 0.20

block bootstrap:
P(net OOS mean return > 0) >= 0.95

calibration:
Brier better than base-rate predictor

